Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grave Pact, Hill Giant and a Mogg Fanatic that came under your control this turn. The opponent is at 4 life and controls an untapped Grizzly Bears. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-sacrifice-trigger-before-ability | Sacrificing Mogg Fanatic is a cost, so Grave Pact triggers at once and resolves before the Fanatic's ability (CR 602.2b, 603.3, 405.5): the opponent must sacrifice the Bears, aim the Fanatic's 1 at the opponent, and the Giant attacks unblocked for 3; aiming it at the Bears wastes it because the Bears are already gone
